<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[顺着季节聊两句 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Season]]>><<pass 2>><<tiredness 1>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[回林恩身边 (0:02)|MP NPC Lin Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
