		<<set _lin.trust to Math.min(100, (_lin.trust or 0) + 1)>>
		<<pain 2>><<stress -2>>
	<<else>>
		<<pain 3>><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>>
	<</if>>
<</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[递哨让他处置 (0:04)|MP NPC Lin Street Hub]]>><<pass 4>><<tiredness 1>>
